ion-shape `_progress.json` schema\n    76|  - §10.2 Source extraction pass\n    77|  - §10.3 Phase A — Skeleton-first\n    78|  - §10.4 Phase B — Populate, one section at a time\n    79|  - §10.5 Tool discipline (hard rules, includes non-ASCII fallback)\n    80|    - §10.5.3 Tool-output retention (context-budget: run full, retain only the verdict / failing slice / distilled evidence)\n</file>","isError":false}}
