{"type":"tool_end","payload":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01ShjiYoFzN2g5HucqjyNx9w","result":"<file path=\"/Users/andres.mesa/_dev/GLB/stepwise-fifa-qa/.coda/skills/analyze-test-cases/references/phase-a-input-validation.md\" lines=\"101\" start=\"1\" end=\"101\" returned=\"101\" has_more=\"false\" truncated=\"false\">\n     1|# Phase A: Input Validation & Pre-flight\n     2|\n     3|## Context Contract\n     4|- **Inputs:** `test_cases_path`, `test_strategy_path`, `automation_code_path`, `project_name`\n     5|- **Outputs:** Validated inputs; `INVENTORY_EXISTS` flag; stale-artifact warnings\n     6|- **Carries Forward:** TC_CONTEXT, STRATEGY_CONTEXT, INVENTORY_CONTEXT populated; _progress.json updated\n     7|- **Flush After:** Raw file-existence check results, stale-artifact timestamps\n     8|- **Dependency:** Step 2A STOP-GATE must have PASSED\n     9|\n    10|---\n    11|\n    12|## Mode-Specific Behavior\n    13|\n    14|- **REPAIR:** Skip this phase entirely UNLESS a directive targets `\"input-validation\"` or `\"global\"`.\n    15|  If targeted, re-run validation to confirm inputs still exist.\n    16|- **BUILD:** Execute fully.\n    17|\n    18|---\n    19|\n    20|## Phase A Instructions\n    21|\n    22|### A.1: Collect Missing Parameters\n    23|\n    24|Use `ask_user` to gather ONLY what is missing. Do NOT re-ask for parameters already provided.\n    25|\n    26|**REQUIRED (ask if missing):**\n    27|1. `project_name` — Project name for artifact headers\n    28|2. `test_cases_path` — Path to test cases\n    29|3. `test_strategy_path` — Path to test strategy\n    30|\n    31|**OPTIONAL (ask only if contextually relevant):**\n    32|4. `analysis_output_path` — Where to write output\n    33|5. `automation_code_path` — Path to check for existing inventory\n    34|\n    35|**CRITICAL:** Wait for user responses before proceeding.\n    36|\n    37|### A.2: Verify Required Input Artifacts\n    38|\n    39|1. **Check `test_cases_path` exists:**\n    40|   - Read the file