d ID patterns\n    84|Log: \"Extracted {N} test case IDs from source.\"\n    85|```\n    86|\n    87|**IMPORTANT:** Every extracted item carries a status field.\n    88|\n    89|---\n    90|\n    91|## Source Fidelity Check (before completing phase)\n    92|- Verify all extracted TC IDs actually exist in the source file\n    93|- Verify `total_count` matches the actual number of entries in `test_cases[]`\n    94|- If inventory was loaded, verify inventory TC IDs are parseable\n    95|\n    96|## Post-Section Protocol\n    97|1. **Update** _progress.json with phase A completion and metrics.\n    98|2. **Flush** raw file contents from memory — they will be re-read in Phase B as needed.\n    99|3. **Verify** `_progress.json` exists and is non-empty.\n   100|4. **Log:** `\"Phase A complete. {N} test cases indexed. Inventory: {true|false}.\"`\n   101|\n</file>","isError":false}}
